# CHANGE OWNER/GROUP/PERMISSIONS OF FILE/DIRECTORY

25) chown
        -change owner of file/DIRECTORY
        -chown user1 dir1 (change the owner of dir1 to user1)
        -chown -R user1 dir1 (changes the owner of dir1 along with sub-directories & files inside dir1 to user1)
        -chown -R user1:group1 dir1 (changes the owner of dir1 to user1 & groups respectively)
26) chgrp 
        -changes mode of file/directory 
        -chgrp group1 dir1 (changes the group of dir1 to group1)
        -chgrp -R group1 dir1 (changes the group of dir1 along with all sub-directories & files of dir1 to group1)
27) chamod 
        -Changes mode of a file/directories 
        -chmod 777 file1
        -chmod -R dir (permissions to be updated of the directory and files inside them aswell)

